lement":{"split":"76,21,3","id":"u_elem_1089580699999988","elemStyle":"","collayouts":[{"colElements":[{"type":"text","element":{"id":"u_elem_1089585199999988","fields":[],"content":"<div style=\"\">\n   <p><br /><\/p>\n  <\/div>"}}]},{"colElements":[{"type":"columns","element":{"split":"44,56","id":"u_elem_1089585300000012","elemStyle":"background-color: rgb(146, 209, 145)","collayouts":[{"colElements":[{"type":"text","element":{"id":"u_elem_10895859000000358","fields":[],"content":"<div\n    style=\"background-color: rgb(146, 209, 145); padding-top: 5px; padding-bottom: 5px\">\n   <p\n      style=\"text-align: right\"><font style=\"margin: 5px; font-size: 14px\"><b>Total<\/b><\/font><\/p>\n  <\/div>"}}]},{"colElements":[{"type":"text","element":{"Fields":[{"Label_Name":"Price"}],"content":"<div style=\"padding-top: 5px; padding-bottom: 5px\">\n   <p\n      style=\"text-align: right\"><font style=\"margin: 5px; font-size: 14px\"><b>${Price}<\/b><\/font><\/p>\n  <\/div>"}}]}]}}]},{"colElements":[{"type":"spacer","element":{"id":"u_elem_1232057699999988","height":"58"}}]}]}},{"type":"columns","element":{"split":"100","id":"u_elem_11116670000000298","elemStyle":"","collayouts":[{"colElements":[{"type":"spacer","element":{"id":"u_elem_11116640000000596","height":"18"}}]}]}},{"type":"columns","element":{"split":"2,98","id":"u_elem_1089586","elemStyle":"","collayouts":[{"colElements":[{"type":"text","element":{"id":"u_elem_10895866000000238","fields":[],"content":"<div style=\"\">\n   <p><br /><\/p>\n  <\/div>"}}]},{"colElements":[{"type":"text","element":{"id":"u_elem_1089586699999988","fields":[],"content":"<div style=\"\">\n   <p><span style=\"font-size: medium; letter-spacing: 0px\">Thank you for your business.<\/span><\/p>\n  <\/div>"}}]}]}},{"type":"columns","element":{"split":"100","id":"u_elem_1089586699999988","elemStyle":"","collayouts":[{"colElements":[{"type":"text","element":{"id":"u_elem_1089586699999988","fields":[],"content":"<div style=\"\">\n   <br />\n   <br />\n  <\/div>"}}]}]}},{"type":"columns","element":{"split":"2,98","id":"u_elem_1089586800000012","elemStyle":"","collayouts":[{"colElements":[{"type":"text","element":{"id":"u_elem_1089591699999988","fields":[],"content":"<div style=\"\">\n   <p><br /><\/p>\n  <\/div>"}}]},{"colElements":[{"type":"text","element":{"id":"u_elem_1089591800000012","fields":[],"content":"<div style=\"\">\n   <p><b\n      style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\">Términos &amp; Condiciones<\/b><\/p>\n   <p><span\n      style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\">El cliente al recibir la factura acepta los términos y condiciones del servicio brindado por Pronto Envíos que se detallan en:&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n   <p><span\n        style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\">&nbsp;<a\n        href=\"https://www.prontoenvios.us/terminos-y-condiciones\"\n        target=\"_blank\" style=\"\"\n        title=\"https://www.prontoenvios.us/terminos-y-condiciones\"\n      rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.prontoenvios.us/terminos-y-condiciones<\/a><b>&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n   <p><span\n      style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\">Pronto Envíos no será responsable por:&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n   <p><span\n      style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\"><span>-Pérdidas o daños de paquetes debido a la incorrecta protección de artículos frágiles y líquidos o exceso de peso recomendado, salvo en los términos del seguro contratado o utilización de servicios de protección ofrecidos por Pronto Envíos.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n   <p><span\n      style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\"><span>-Errores u omisiones en la información proporcionada por el cliente que ocasionen pérdidas o demoras en la entrega.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n   <p><span\n      style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\"><span>-Incumplimientos de tiempos de entregas por parte de empresas transportistas, aduanas o autoridades gubernamentales.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n   <p><span\n      style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\">-El cliente debe declarar toda la carga y su estado de forma precisa. En caso de subdeclaración, Pronto Envíos puede actuar para proteger la seguridad de otros envíos y personas, siguiendo las leyes vigentes tanto en origen como destino. El cliente asume la responsabilidad por cualquier falta en la declaración y exime, a Pronto Envíos, de daños derivados de esto.<\/span><\/p>\n   <p><span\n      style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px\"><br /><\/span><\/p>\n   <p><span\n    style=\"letter-spacing: 0px\"> <\/span><\/p>\n   <p style=\"\"><font\n        style=\"font-size: 16px\"><b\n    style=\"font-size: 16px\">Terms &amp; Conditions<\/b><\/font><\/p>\n   <p\n      style=\"\"><font\n    style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span>Upon receiving the invoice, the customer accepts the terms and conditions of the service provided by Pronto Envíos, as detailed at:<\/span><\/font><\/p>\n   <p\n      style=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span><a target=\"_blank\"\n          href=\"https://www.prontoenvios.us/terminos-y-condiciones\"\n          title=\"https://www.prontoenvios.us/terminos-y-condiciones\"\n    rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>https://www.prontoenvios.us/terms-and-conditions<\/b><\/a>&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/p>\n   <p\n      style=\"\"><font\n    style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span>Pronto Envíos will not be responsible for:&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/p>\n   <p\n      style=\"\"><font\n    style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span>- Loss or damage to packages due to improper protection of fragile and liquid items or excess recommended weight, except under the terms of the insurance contracted or the use of protection services offered by Pronto Envíos.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/p>\n   <p\n      style=\"\"><font\n    style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span>- Errors or omissions in the information provided by the customer that cause loss or delays in delivery.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/p>\n   <p\n      style=\"\"><font\n    style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span>- Failure to comply with delivery times by shipping companies, customs, or government authorities.&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><\/p>\n   <p\n      style=\"\"><font style=\"font-size: 16px\">- The customer must accurately declare all cargo and its condition. In the event of underdeclaration, Pronto Envíos may take action to protect the safety of other shipments and people, following applicable laws at both the origin and destination. The customer assumes responsibility for any failure to declare and releases Pronto Envíos from any resulting damages.<\/font><\/p>\n   <br />\n   <p><\/p>\n  <\/div>"}}]}]}}],"id":1}],"resize":"A4","themeFont":"opensans","isHeaderEnabled":false}
